{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rope grabber is a twin stick shooter and pet walkin' sim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">FEATURES THAT EXIST CURRENTLY IN THE GAME DEMO MADE ON A 0 DOLLAR BUDGET:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-----------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-PICK YOUR PET</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-SHOOT ZOMBIE WHILE OUT FOR A WALK</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-GET THE HIGHSCORE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-FIGURE OUT THE BONUS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-POST THE NUMERIC REPRESENTATION OF YOUR IMPRESSIVE SKILL ONLINE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">NOTE:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">------BUG AND FIXES-------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">if you want to use online hi score, execute the game outside of the steam client!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I gotta fix some server stuff. sorry broskis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Also the copyright symbol is the enter on the highscore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steam overlay integration is wonky so you might have to force quit.'</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">QUIT WORKS PRESS 'Q' IN PAUSE 'ESC' AND GAMEOVER MENU</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game is in current in EARLY PROTOTYPE DEMO PHASE,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With the actual purchase in the future\u00a0 you can likely expect (given met time and budget requirements instead of zero):</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More pet selection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">AND MORE STUFF BECAUSE I AIN'T JUST IN IT FOR MAKING MONEY FOR THE LEAST AMOUNT OF WORK.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3492960?t=1743121842","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492960/95ba8cb9a6abded638ba8ced2db7dcd0bd00c623/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=17431218